{#
  For a reader who does not touch the cloud console.

  Deliberately does not list findings. An executive summary that ends in a
  four-hundred-row table is a technical report with a cover page, and the
  question it is meant to answer -- how exposed are we, and is it getting
  better -- gets buried in the answer to a different one.
#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% set title = "Executive security report" %}

{% block body %}

{% include "_posture.html.j2" %}

{% if 'top_risks' in report.sections %}
{% include "_top_risks.html.j2" %}
{% endif %}

{% if 'attack_paths' in report.sections %}
{% include "_attack_paths.html.j2" %}
{% endif %}

{% if 'remediation' in report.sections %}
{% include "_remediation.html.j2" %}
{% endif %}

{% if 'compliance' in report.sections %}
{% include "_compliance.html.j2" %}
{% endif %}

{% endblock %}
